    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McDonald Property are delighted to present 24 Earlsfort Rise, Lucan to the property market.\n\nThis well maintained, 3-bedroom family home is ideally situated on a quiet, peaceful road within the highly sought-after Earlsfort Estate.\n\nSpanning approximately 953 sq. ft., the property offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers and growing families alike.\n\nAccommodation Features:\n\nEntrance Hallway: A warm and welcoming entrance featuring comfortable carpeting.\n\nLiving Room: Positioned to the front of the house, this bright and airy space is carpeted and features an elegant open hearth fireplace with a marble surround. Double doors lead seamlessly through to the dining room.\n\nDining Room: to rear of hosue with patio doors to private garden.\n\nKitchen: The functional kitchen comes equipped with classic cream-coloured units at both floor- and eye-level, complemented by a tiled splashback, a Tricity Bendix washing machine, and an oven. The kitchen provides direct access to the rear garden.\n\nUPSTAIRS:\n\nMaster Bedroom: Located to the rear of the house, offering generous built-in wardrobe space and a private en-suite bathroom complete with a WC, WHB, shower unit, and an external window for natural light.\n\nBedroom 2: A spacious double bedroom situated to the front of the property, complete with built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3: facing the front, featuring fitted wardrobes.\n\nFamily Bathroom: A well-appointed bathroom featuring wooden flooring, a WC, WHB, a bath, and a side-facing window.\n\nOutside Spaces:\n\nRear Garden: A private, fully fenced rear garden laid out in a neat lawnideal for kids to play or for gardening enthusiasts.\n\nFront Garden Parking: A neat walled front lawn with mature shrubbery.\n\nPrivate driveway providing ample off-road parking.\n\nKey Features Include:\n\nPresented in good condition throughout\n\nGas-fired central heating\n\nHighly desirable chain-free sale for a smooth, swift transaction\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate everything this wonderful home has to offer.\n\nThe property is situated within walking distance of an array of reputable educational options. Local schools include Lucan Community National School, St. Bernadette's Junior and Senior National Schools, and St. Mary's Senior National School.\n\nWalking distance to Ballyowen Shopping Centre\n\nLiffey Valley Shopping Centre is also just a short distance away.\n\nExcellent sports clubs, leisure facilities, and green spaces are also nearby"
      },
